<title>USA: Harcourt launches offer for Natl Education.</title>
<headline>Harcourt launches offer for Natl Education.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTNUT HILL, Mass. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harcourt General Inc said on Monday one of its units has launched its previously-announced $19.50 a share cash tender offer for National Education Corp.</p>
</text>
